  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Stockholm Forum on Peace and Development 2025 - Stockholm Forum on Peace and Development May 2025</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Stockholm Forum on Peace and Development 2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till Stockholm International Peace Research Institute (SIPRI) f&#xf6;r genomf&#xf6;randet av det &#xe5;rliga &#xe5;terkommande Stockholm Forum on Peace and Development i maj 2025. Samfinansieras med Folke Bernadotte Akademin (FBA) i syfte att utg&#xf6;ra en plattform f&#xf6;r humanit&#xe4;ra akt&#xf6;rer, fredsbyggare och utvecklingsakt&#xf6;rer att dela kunskap och diskutera utmaningar relaterat till global fred och s&#xe4;kerhet i syfte att fr&#xe4;mja en mer fredlig framtid.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the Stockholm International Peace Research Institute (SIPRI) for the implementation of the annual Stockholm Forum on Peace and Development in May 2025. Co-financed with the Folke Bernadotte Academy (FBA) with the overall objective to provide a space for humanitarian, development, security and climate communities to share knowledge and best practices, discuss key challenges in the peace and development arena to advance a more peaceful future.</narrative>
  </description>
